notes = "Stockholm, after the collision of 25 July 1956. Beam 21 m (source). Box length 96 m: her 160 m overall at a block coefficient near 0.6 (est.), at a 7.6 m draught (est.). Depth 12 m (est.). Weight 7.44 m over her keel: GM 1.2 m (est.). Her bow forward of her collision wall, 10 m of it (est.), crushed open to the sea through 10 m² (est.); the fine bow holds 0.35 of its box (est.)."
